  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aid Harmonization and Program Management Support (Cambodia)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Aid Harmonization and Program Management Support investment supports the effective implementation and coordination of Post&#x2019;s development portfolio. It has two main components:
1.	Strategic Program Support:  Provides enabling and quality support for the management of the development portfolio
2.	Partnership for Development Results: Provides funding to the United Nations Development Programme (UNDP) for enhanced coordination and harmonisation among international donors to Cambodia to improve partnership with the Government of Cambodia and development impact.</narrative>
  </description>
